      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "冷小西很想回西京大学，看看那些猫。",
      "traditional": "冷小西很想回西京大學，看看那些貓。",
      "pinyin": "lěng xiǎo xī hěn xiǎng huí xī jīng dà xué kàn kan nà xiē māo",
      "english": "Leng Xiaoxi really wants to go back to Xijing University and see the cats."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "但是现在她工作了，不是学生了。",
      "traditional": "但是現在她工作了，不是學生了。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì xiàn zài tā gōng zuò le bú shì xué sheng le",
      "english": "But she is now working and is no longer a student."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "她没有学生卡了，不能进西京大学了。她有点儿不高兴，怎么进去呢？",
      "traditional": "她沒有學生卡了，不能進西京大學了。她有點兒不高興，怎麼進去呢？",
      "pinyin": "tā méi yǒu xué sheng kǎ le bù néng jìn xī jīng dà xué le tā yǒu diǎn'r bù gāo xìng zěn me jìn qù ne",
      "english": "She doesn’t have a student card and can’t enter Xijing University anymore. She is a little unhappy. How can she get in?"
    },
    {
