      "simplified": "这个学妹也是西京大学的学生，今年大二。",
      "traditional": "這個學妹也是西京大學的學生，今年大二。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge xué mèi yě shì xī jīng dà xué de xué sheng jīn nián dà èr",
      "english": "This junior schoolmate is also a student at Xijing University. She is in Year 2 this year."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "学妹是冷小西的好朋友，她要在日本学习一年，现在不住在学校。",
      "traditional": "學妹是冷小西的好朋友，她要在日本學習一年，現在不住在學校。",
      "pinyin": "xué mèi shì lěng xiǎo xī de hǎo péng you tā yào zài rì běn xué xí yì nián xiàn zài bú zhù zài xué xiào",
      "english": "The junior schoolmate is Leng Xiaoxi’s good friend. She must study in Japan for a year, and isn’t living at school now."
    },
    {
