    "sentence_translations": [
      "(2) Where Are The Cats?",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi really wants to go back to Xijing University and see the cats.",
      "But she is now working and is no longer a student.",
      "She doesn’t have a student card and can’t enter Xijing University anymore. She is a little unhappy. How can she get in?",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi knows a junior female schoolmate.",
      "This junior schoolmate is also a student at Xijing University. She is in Year 2 this year.",
      "The junior schoolmate is Leng Xiaoxi’s good friend. She must study in Japan for a year, and isn’t living at school now.",
      "She gives Leng Xiaoxi a student card.",
      "With this card, Leng Xiaoxi can enter Xijing University and can see the cats. She is very happy.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi returns to the school. She brings some things for the cats to eat.",
      "Leng Xiaoxi goes to the small store. The cats are not there.",
      "Leng Xiaoxi goes to the small restaurant. The cats are also not there. Where are the cats?"
    ]
